ID\\:** `turn327965news4`\n- **URL\\:** \ue200url\ue202https\\://www\\.forbes.com/sites/forbes-personal-shopper/article/walmart-promo-codes/\ue202https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbes-personal-shopper/article/walmart-promo-codes/\ue201\n\n**Full excerpt\\:**\n\n```text\n# Walmart Promo Codes: Save Up To 75% On Tech, Home, Toys And More\n\nByKara Cuzzone,\n\nSupervising Deals Editor.\n\nI've been helping readers find the best deals for over five years.\n\nReviewed ByElsie Boskamp,\n\nSr. Deals Editor.\n\nFollow Authors\n\nOct 28, 2026, 02:28pm EDT\n\n### Best Walmart Promo Codes And Deals Right Now\n\nOct 28, 2026, 02:27pm EDT\n\n75% off\n\nAs deals editors, we spend our days researching the absolute best discounts from top retailers. So naturally, we\u2019re pretty familiar with Walmart sales, where you can find a wide selection of products at competitive prices. With Rollback deals and Walmart promo codes, you can save up to 75% on tech, home goods, toys and more. I combed through the offers and rounded up the best Walmart discounts available right now.\n\nSave on Rollback deals with Walmart promo codes and discounts.\n\nILLUSTRATION: FORBES / PHOTOS: RETAILER\n\nWant to read this story later?\n\nGet a link sent straight to your inbox.\n\nRemind Me\n\nWe've sent this story to your inbox.\n\nYou can take up to 75% off across all categories, including beauty, tech, home and toys when shopping the retail giant\u2019s Rollback deals. Right now, the Beats Studio Pro Wireless Headphones (which are our pick for the best over ear headphones for working out) are up to 50% off, while the best-selling Bissell Little Green Portable Deep Cleaner is 27% off.\n```\n\n### 2\\. Best REI coupons and promo codes we've tested in October 2026\n\n- **Reference ID\\:** `turn327965news5`\n- **URL\\:** \ue200url\ue202https\\://www\\.businessinsider.com/guides/deals/best-rei-coupons-promo-discount-codes\ue202https://www.businessinsider.com/guides/deals/best-rei-coupons-promo-discount-codes\ue201\n\n**Full excerpt\\:**\n\n```text\n# Best REI coupons and promo codes we've tested in October 2026\n\nWritten by Jennifer Gonick\n\nYou're currently following this author! Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n\nand Lillian Brown\n\nYou're currently following this author! Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n\nWhen you buy through our links, Business Insider may earn an affiliate commission. Learn more\n\nImage: REI brand image\n\n[Input] These REI coupons can help you save on outdoor gear. REI\n\nUpdate: We've scoured the internet for REI coupons, but we haven't found any active promo codes at the time of writing. We're constantly on the lookout for new discounts, so keep checking back for updates. In the meantime, if you're still interested in shopping at REI today, you can explore the retailer's ongoing deals below or head back to your cart.\n\nREI is the go-to retailer for all things outdoor adventure, whether you're looking to make a major gear purchase or simply hoping to add to your athleisure collection. Customers can shop a variety of popular outdoor brands, and products are often available at a discount. While deals are pretty common, an easy way to get the absolute lowest price at checkout is by using one of the best REI coupons and promo codes.\n\nWhile the retailer carries basics like backpacks, tents, and sleeping bags, REI's inventory extends far beyond that. The brand carries gear for all seasons, ranging from snowboards to paddleboards, along with a massive selection of durable, performance-driven apparel and footwear. Another great option is the REI Outlet, where past-season favorites are often marked down significantly. We've highlighted the top REI deals below so you can get the most savings on your next purchase. The offers include general sales, coupon codes, and volume discounts, so there's a decent chance that something in your order might be available at a discounted price. We also sometimes spot exclusive offers for REI Co-op members.\n\n* * *\n\n## Today's best REI coupons and promo codes\n\n  * At the time of writing, there are no active REI coupon codes. We'll continue to search for active codes and update this page if we find any. You can learn about previous voucher codes and other ongoing deals below:\n  * Back to your cart\n\nBusiness Insider has Games!\n\n## Previous REI coupons\n\nThese codes are for previous REI promotions that have since expired but may be reactivated in the future.\n```\n\n### 3\\. Top Target Promo Codes for October 2026\n\n- **Reference ID\\:** `turn327965news6`\n- **URL\\:** \ue200url\ue202https\\://www\\.wired.com/story/target-promo-code/\ue202https://www.wired.com/story/target-promo-code/\ue201\n\n**Full excerpt\\:**\n\n```text\n# Top Target Promo Codes for October 2026\n\nHome Depot Promo Codes: 30% Off in October 2026\n\nSave up to 50% today with the latest Home Depot promo codes for appliances, power tools, and more this October.\n\nMolly Higgins\n\nWalmart Promo Codes: 20% Off for October 2026\n\nScore $10 off with our Walmart promo codes and coupon, and shop flash deals up to 65% off today.\n\nMolly Higgins\n\nTop Lowe\u2019s Promo Codes: Up to $300 Off Appliances\n\nFind the latest Lowe\u2019s promo codes and offers, including up to $300 off select major appliances and $5 off $50 with sign-up, here at WIRED.\n\nMolly Higgins\n\nTop Dell Coupon Codes: 20% Off for October 2026\n\nGet 20% off with verified Dell promo code, plus today\u2019s coupons for up to $600 off laptops, Alienware monitors, and all things tech.\n\nLuke Larsen\n\nInstacart Promo Code: $15 Off for October 2026\n\nFind the best Instacart promo code for massive savings in October 2026.\n\nMolly Higgins\n\nTop Newegg Promo Codes and Coupons for October 2026\n\nEnjoy up to 10% off your entire order with today\u2019s Newegg promo code and discount codes. Save with the latest deals for gaming PCs, laptops, and computer parts.\n\nMolly Higgins\n\nTop Design Within Reach Promo Codes for October 2026\n\nGet 30% off, 20% off, and free shipping with our Design Within Reach coupon codes, plus up to 50% off furniture with these special discounts.\n\nNena Farrell\n\nWalgreens Photo Coupon: Save Big in October 2026\n\nPreserving your memories doesn't have to be expensive. Use a verified Walgreens coupon code for discounts of up to 70% off premium wall decor, stationery, and personalized gifts, as well as beauty, lenses, and health products this fall.\n\nNena Farrell\n\nSephora Promo Codes: 20% Off for October 2026\n\nEarn more points on skincare purchases when you use our Sephora coupon.\n\nLouryn Strampe\n\nTop Groupon Promo Codes: 60% Off in 2026\n\nUnlock up to 60% off, 40% off packages, and 20% off with top Groupon coupon codes. Explore coupons to save on travel getaways, holiday gifts, and event tickets.\n\nMolly Higgins\n\nTop Ulta Beauty Promo Codes: 20% Off\n\nShop the latest beauty trends and save big using an Ulta promo code, plus up to 20% off.\n\nBoutayna Chokrane\n\nTop KitchenAid Promo Codes for October 2026\n```\n\n### 4\\. Dell Promo Codes: Save Up To \\$600 On Devices During The Top Tech Event\n\n- **Reference ID\\:** `turn327965news7`\n- **URL\\:** \ue200url\ue202https\\://www\\.forbes.com/sites/forbes-personal-shopper/article/dell-promo-codes/\ue202https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbes-personal-shopper/article/dell-promo-codes/\ue201\n\n**Full excerpt\\:**\n\n```text\n# Dell Promo Codes: Save Up To $600 On Devices During The Top Tech Event\n\nByKara Cuzzone,\n\nSupervising Deals Editor.\n\nI've been helping readers find the best deals for over five years.\n\nReviewed ByElsie Boskamp,\n\nSr. Deals Editor.\n\nFollow Authors\n\nOct 23, 2026, 03:37pm EDT\n\n### Best Dell Promo Codes And Deals Right Now\n\nOct 23, 2026, 03:35pm EDT\n\n$600 off\n\n### Up to $600 off during the Top Tech Event.\n\nVerified10/23/2026\n\nUse By\n\nGet Deal\n\n$600 Off\n\n### Up to $600 off gaming equipment.\n\nVerified10/23/2026\n\nUse By\n\nGet Deal\n\n$550 Off\n\n### Up to $550 off desktops.\n\nVerified10/23/2026\n\nUse By\n\nGet Deal\n\n$510 Off\n\nOur tech team has rigorously tested dozens of computers and laptops, with several Dell models\u2014like the since-discontinued Dell 14\u2014earning spots in our shopping guides. Whether you\u2019re shopping for a new laptop or monitor, looking for Dell promo codes and deals can help you save. Although our team didn\u2019t find any active Dell coupons at the moment, there are still significant discounts available during the brand\u2019s Top Tech Event. After testing a variety of advertised Dell discount codes, our editors found none that are currently active. However, there are several great deals live on Dell\u2019s site right now\u2014we listed the best ones here.\n\nSave on top-rated devices with these Dell promo codes and offers.\n\nILLUSTRATION: FORBES / PHOTOS: RETAILER\n\nWant to read this story later?\n\nGet a link sent straight to your inbox.\n\nRemind Me\n\nWe've sent this story to your inbox.\n\n## Shop The Top Tech Event\n\nDell is offering a wide range of deals this week during the Top Tech Event. Shoppers can take up to $600 off select gaming equipment, PCs, laptops and more. After browsing its offers, a few that caught our eye include the Dell 16 Laptop for $100 off and the Dell Slim Desktop for $200 off.\n```\n\n### 5\\."},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/clientDefinedWidgets/860586b1-a150-5503-b6d9-5fb54b8a72cc/isStreaming","o":"replace","v":false}]}   

